    <string name="dejavu_sync_firefox_summary">Cata computator e telephono con Firefox ha su proprie spatio de labor: le schedas fixate resta fixate, le gruppos de schedas deveni dossiers in lor colores, e su altere schedas se aperi illac. In iste spatios de labor tu pote aperir e clauder schedas, e le apparato face le mesme.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_zen_summary">Spatios de labor, schedas fixate, essentiales e dossiers resta identic in Zen e in Dejavu, in ambe directiones.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_switch_from_zen">Le spatios de labor de Zen resta in Dejavu, ma non se synchronisa plus.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_switch_from_firefox">Le spatios de labor de tu apparatos con Firefox quita Dejavu. Firefox conserva lor schedas.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_problem_choose">Le synchronisation es in pausa usque tu elige Firefox o Zen.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_problem_tabs_off">Le synchronisation de schedas aperte es disactivate pro tu conto Mozilla. Activa Schedas aperte in le parametros de synchronisation de tu conto, hic o in Firefox.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_problem_no_firefox">Ancora nulle Firefox super un altere apparato synchronisa su schedas aperte con tu conto.</string>
